</path></svg></button></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-full px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-20 bg-ssl-light-bg\" id=\"why-ssl\"><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-16 md:text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-500\">WHY PARTNER WITH SSL</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">Built Different, By Design</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">We&#x27;re not just another agency. Our unique blend of technical expertise, data-driven strategies, and end-to-end execution ensures your digital presence isn&#x27;t just visible, but dominant.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div style=\"animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:0.8s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"gap-3 w-full items-start [--icon-bg:theme(colors.slate.100)] [--icon-border:theme(colors.slate.200)] [--icon-text:theme(colors.ssl-blue)] [--title-text:theme(colors.ssl-bg)] [--description-text:theme(colors.slate.700)] [&amp;&gt;div]:!bg-[var(--icon-bg)] [&amp;&gt;div]:!border-[var(--icon-border)] [&amp;&gt;div]:!text-[var(--icon-text)] [&amp;&gt;h3]:!text-[var(--title-text)] [&amp;&gt;p]:!text-[var(--description-text)] hover:[&amp;&gt;div]:!bg-[var(--icon-text)] hover:[&amp;&gt;div]:!text-white h-full flex flex-col justify-between p-6 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm border border-slate-100 transform transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-slate-800/40 text-slate-300 group-hover:bg-slate-800 group-hover:text-amber-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-no-axes-column lucide-bar-chart-2 h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 21v-6\"></path><path d=\"M12 21V3\"></path><path d=\"M19 21V9\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100 tracking-tight\">Truth Metrics</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">We replace vanity metrics like clicks and impressions with pipeline value, conversion velocity, and revenue — the numbers that actually move your business forward.</p></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.15s;animation-duration:0.8s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"gap-3 w-full items-start [--icon-bg:theme(colors.slate.100)] [--icon-border:theme(colors.slate.200)] [--icon-text:theme(colors.ssl-blue)] [--title-text:theme(colors.ssl-bg)] [--description-text:theme(colors.slate.700)] [&amp;&gt;div]:!bg-[var(--icon-bg)] [&amp;&gt;div]:!border-[var(--icon-border)] [&amp;&gt;div]:!text-[var(--icon-text)] [&amp;&gt;h3]:!text-[var(--title-text)] [&amp;&gt;p]:!text-[var(--description-text)] hover:[&amp;&gt;div]:!bg-[var(--icon-text)] hover:[&amp;&gt;div]:!text-white h-full flex flex-col justify-between p-6 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm border border-slate-100 transform transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-slate-800/40 text-slate-300 group-hover:bg-slate-800 group-hover:text-amber-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6\"></path><path d=\"m8 6-6 6 6 6\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100 tracking-tight\">Technical Depth</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">Real engineering, not surface-level campaigns. Every strategy is backed by production-grade code, serverless architecture, and systems built to scale without breaking.</p></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.3s;animation-duration:0.8s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"gap-3 w-full items-start [--icon-bg:theme(colors.slate.100)] [--icon-border:theme(colors.slate.200)] [--icon-text:theme(colors.ssl-blue)] [--title-text:theme(colors.ssl-bg)] [--description-text:theme(colors.slate.700)] [&amp;&gt;div]:!bg-[var(--icon-bg)] [&amp;&gt;div]:!border-[var(--icon-border)] [&amp;&gt;div]:!text-[var(--icon-text)] [&amp;&gt;h3]:!text-[var(--title-text)] [&amp;&gt;p]:!text-[var(--description-text)] hover:[&amp;&gt;div]:!bg-[var(--icon-text)] hover:[&amp;&gt;div]:!text-white h-full flex flex-col justify-between p-6 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm border border-slate-100 transform transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-md hover:-translate-y-1\"><div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-colors duration-300 bg-slate-800/40 text-slate-300 group-hover:bg-slate-800 group-hover:text-amber-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers lucide-layers-3 h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-slate-100 tracking-tight\">Full-Stack Execution</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed\">From market strategy to shipped code, one team owns the entire system — no handoffs, no diluted vision, no lost context along the way.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-ssl-light-bg px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-20\" id=\"process\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-12 md:mb-16\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-500\">HOW WE ENGAGE</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">The SSL Engagement System</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Our structured, data-first methodology designed to transform technical infrastructure into a high-performance growth engine.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 lg:gap-8\"><div style=\"animation-delay:0s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-start h-full p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-black text-ssl-blue/20 mb-4 font-display\">01</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg mb-3 font-display\">Signal Diagnostic</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">We audit your current stack, funnel, and data flows to identify exactly where signal is being lost — no assumptions, only measured findings.</p><div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-16 -right-5 w-10 h-px bg-ssl-gold/30\"></div></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.15s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-start h-full p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-black text-ssl-blue/20 mb-4 font-display\">02</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg mb-3 font-display\">Systems Architecture</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">We design the technical and growth architecture to fix it: infrastructure, automation, and acquisition systems mapped as one connected system, not isolated fixes.</p><div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-16 -right-5 w-10 h-px bg-ssl-gold/30\"></div></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.3s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-start h-full p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-black text-ssl-blue/20 mb-4 font-display\">03</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg mb-3 font-display\">Engineering Sprint</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">We build and ship — production-grade code, integrated systems, and campaigns launched in focused, accountable sprints.</p><div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-16 -right-5 w-10 h-px bg-ssl-gold/30\"></div></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.44999999999999996s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-start h-full p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\"><div class=\"text-4xl font-black text-ssl-blue/20 mb-4 font-display\">04</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ssl-bg mb-3 font-display\">Optimize &amp; Scale</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600\">We track pipeline value and conversion velocity post-launch, iterating the system continuously rather than declaring it finished.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-ssl-light-bg px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-20\" id=\"testimonials\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center mb-12 md:mb-16\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-500\">WHAT PARTNERS SAY</p><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl text-ssl-bg\">Evidence of Market Command</h2><p class=\"text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">How high-growth enterprises are leveraging SSL to engineer their digital infrastructure.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8\"><div style=\"animation-delay:0s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:scale-[1.015] hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col p-6 bg-white border border-slate-100 hover:border-ssl-gold/30\"><div class=\"p-0 flex flex-col h-full\"><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-grow italic\">“<!-- -->SSL transformed our fragmented tech stack into a unified growth engine. The visibility we now have into pipeline velocity is exactly what we were missing.<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mt-auto border-t border-slate-100 pt-6\"><div class=\"h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-ssl-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center text-ssl-blue font-bold text-lg border border-ssl-blue/20\">E</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg\">[Client Name]</div><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide\">[Role]<!-- --> @ <!-- -->[Enterprise Client]</div></div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.15s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:scale-[1.015] hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col p-6 bg-white border border-slate-100 hover:border-ssl-gold/30\"><div class=\"p-0 flex flex-col h-full\"><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-grow italic\">“<!-- -->Their approach to infrastructure isn’t just about &quot;development&quot; — it’s about engineering systems that directly drive revenue and acquisition efficiency.<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mt-auto border-t border-slate-100 pt-6\"><div class=\"h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-ssl-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center text-ssl-blue font-bold text-lg border border-ssl-blue/20\">C</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg\">[Client Name]</div><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide\">[Role]<!-- --> @ <!-- -->[Enterprise Client]</div></div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"animation-delay:0.3s\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div class=\"rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-ssl-gold/5 hover:scale-[1.015] hover:-translate-y-0.5 overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col p-6 bg-white border border-slate-100 hover:border-ssl-gold/30\"><div class=\"p-0 flex flex-col h-full\"><p class=\"text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8 flex-grow italic\">“<!-- -->The technical depth they brought to our data architecture was immediate. They replaced our assumptions with measurable, high-performance truth metrics.<!-- -->”</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mt-auto border-t border-slate-100 pt-6\"><div class=\"h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-ssl-blue/10 flex items-center justify-center text-ssl-blue font-bold text-lg border border-ssl-blue/20\">S</div><div><div class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg\">[Client Name]</div><div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wide\">[Role]<!-- --> @ <!-- -->[Enterprise Client]</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-20 bg-ssl-light-bg\"><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:scale-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1087490814 \"><div class=\"glass-card-dark glass-card-dark-static mx-auto max-w-5xl rounded-3xl p-12 md:p-20 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-fluid-h2 font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-6\">Ready to Force Your Signal Through the Chaos?</h2><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed\">Stop reacting to the market. Start engineering your market position with enterprise-grade growth infrastructure.</p><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-slate-950 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 dark:focus-visible:ring-slate-300 bg-[#C5A059] text-[#01081b] hover:bg-[#b08e4d] font-medium transition-colors h-11 text-lg px-10 py-6\">Start a Project</button></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-ssl-light-bg border-t border-slate-200/60 px-6 py-20\" id=\"contact\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-4xl grid-cols-1 items-start gap-12 pb-4 pt-2 md:grid-cols-2\"><div style=\"animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% cover 35%;animation-fill-mode:both;animation-name:slide-up-in;animation-duration:1s;animation-timing-function:ease-out\" class=\"jsx-1138063265 \"><div id=\"about\"><h2 class=\"mb-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ssl-bg md:text-4xl\">Get in Touch</h2><p class=\"mb-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700\">Our team is ready to discuss your requirements. Send us a message and we&#x27;ll be in touch shortly.</p><div class=\"space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg w-20\">Address:</span><span>Thome, Nairobi - Kenya</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg w-20\">Phone:</span><a href=\"tel:+254712895903\" class=\"hover:text-ssl-blue transition-colors\">+254 712 895 903</a></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg w-20\">Email:</span><a href=\"mailto:connect@signalstraitlabs.com\" class=\"hover:text-ssl-blue transition-colors\">connect@signalstraitlabs.com</a></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"font-bold text-ssl-bg w-20\">Soci